From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 21 Oct 2026 16:43:46 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] UI-FLOWS-1: the add form fills a payee's usual envelope
 again
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Typing a known payee on /add left the envelope on "Choose where it came
from…", and choosing an account and an envelope from different budgets
never explained the filing. Both client features looked the envelope up
as #category_id with data-budget on its options; 30e12df made it the
first split line (split_category_0) with plain options, so both returned
silently. The client now finds the first line, and the lines carry each
option's budget and group by budget when they span more than one.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_016zXWwzys3K4XksLh3rrcKu
